<mxCell id="n140" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#333333&quot;&gt;robot_pvt_controller  ·  PVT (CiA 402 mode 5) parameters&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9px;color:#666666;font-family:Courier New&quot;&gt;drive_side_pd:true (drive runs PD law)  ·  body_group full | upper | lower (split plugin instances, disjoint rosters)&lt;br&gt;cmd per joint: q_des, v_des, τ_ff, Kp, Kd  →  τ = Kp·Δq + Kd·Δv + τ_ff in firmware @1 kHz&lt;br&gt;gravity FF τ_g = mgl[j]·sin(q[j]−q_eq[j]) (arms only, bench-tuned per joint, ff_gravity false at boot)&lt;br&gt;Kd_damp braking ramp · lag governor lag_free 0.04s / lag_pause 0.14s / alpha_slew 2.0 · spawned INACTIVE&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#333333;dashed=0;arcSize=5;strokeWidth=1.3;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=3;spacingLeft=7;spacingRight=6;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="56" y="2118" width="1480" height="118" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="n141" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#333333&quot;&gt;harambe_policy_controller  ·  RL deploy parameters&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9px;color:#666666;font-family:Courier New&quot;&gt;update 200 Hz · policy 50 Hz (decimation 4) · effort command (drive-side PD)&lt;br&gt;obs: joint q/qd, IMU ω+grav (/pelvis,/torso), /cmd_vel, last action · action_scale 0.25 · clip 5.0&lt;br&gt;kp Isaac ActuatorCfg: shoulder≈114 · hip≈466 · ankle≈996 · 25 joints HARDWARE_JOINT_ORDER&lt;br&gt;warmup 200 steps (boosted gains) · fall guard |grav_z|&amp;lt;0.5 · ~/enable gate&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#333333;dashed=0;arcSize=5;strokeWidth=1.3;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=3;spacingLeft=7;spacingRight=6;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1552" y="2118" width="1000" height="118" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="n142" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#24401a&quot;&gt;ros2_control interfaces&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9px;color:#666666;font-family:Courier New&quot;&gt;command:&lt;br&gt;  position · velocity · effort&lt;br&gt;  kp · kd · mode_of_operation&lt;br&gt;state:&lt;br&gt;  position · velocity · effort · status_word&lt;br&gt;CiA402 modes: 8 CSP · 9 CSV · 10 CST · 5 PVT&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontColor=#24401a;dashed=0;arcSize=5;strokeWidth=1.3;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=3;spacingLeft=7;spacingRight=6;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2568" y="2118" width="776" height="118" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="n143" value="§ 05 · ROBOT MODEL  —  URDF / xacro  (single source of truth)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#9673a6;dashed=0;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontColor=#9673a6;fontFamily=Courier New;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="2290" width="3320" height="300" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="n144" value="&lt;b style=&quot;color:#9673a6;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1px&quot;&gt;WHAT THIS LAYER DOES&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#3a3a34;line-height:1.35&quot;&gt;One parametric model feeds every layer. full_robot_description assembles links + joints (exact, never-rounded origins from urdf/joints/*) into the robot. The use_sim xacro arg is the master sim/real switch: true loads the Gazebo gz_ros2_control hardware tag, false loads the EtherCAT hardware tag with per-joint &amp;lt;ec_module&amp;gt; slave configs. Further args select PVT vs CSP, read-only vs gravcomp config dirs, ankle driver v1/v2, fixed_legs, only_left. robot_state_publisher turns this model into /tf; MoveIt reads it as /robot_description; the controllers read joint limits and effort caps from it.&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fbfbf7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontColor=#3a3a34;dashed=0;arcSize=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=4;spacingLeft=9;spacingRight=9;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="56" y="2332" width="3288" height="68" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="n145" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#42285a&quot;&gt;full_robot_description&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8px;color:#666666;font-family:Courier New&quot;&gt;25 DOF + hands · full_robot.urdf.xacro&lt;br&gt;view_robot.rviz · full_robot_gazebo.xacro&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontColor=#42285a;dashed=0;arcSize=5;strokeWidth=1.3;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=3;spacingLeft=7;spacingRight=6;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="56" y="2410" width="534" height="74" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
