<mxCell id="n218" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#333333&quot;&gt;MyActuator RMD X V4 motor families&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9px;color:#666666;font-family:Courier New&quot;&gt;X4 (blue) 36:1 · Kt 1.9 · I_rated 8.625 A — wrists/ankles/yaw (10 drives)&lt;br&gt;X6 (orange) 19.612:1 · Kt 2.1 · I_rated 13.40 A — shoulder/elbow (6 drives)&lt;br&gt;X8 (red) 19.612:1 · Kt 2.4 · I_rated 24.88 A — waist/hip/knee (9 drives)&lt;br&gt;encoder ±65535 = ±180° → π/65535 rad/count · factor_cmd = 1000/(Kt·I_rated)&lt;br&gt;modes CSP/CSV/CST/PVT · max_torque SDO default 50%&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#333333;dashed=0;arcSize=5;strokeWidth=1.3;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=3;spacingLeft=7;spacingRight=6;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="56" y="3514" width="1040" height="160" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="n219" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#333333&quot;&gt;Differential ankle linkage  +  calibration&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9px;color:#666666;font-family:Courier New&quot;&gt;eccentric-pushrod serial chain · 2×X4 per ankle (pitch+roll coupled)&lt;br&gt;v1 analytic IK/FK · v2 calibrated cubic-primary (mirror-crank), analytic compare on /ankle_method_compare&lt;br&gt;per-joint zero-offset (raw cnt) + direction(±1, negate factors)&lt;br&gt;e.g. L_sh_pitch offset 2704 dir−1 · L_sh_yaw 28044 · recalib: demo_joint_offset&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#333333;dashed=0;arcSize=5;strokeWidth=1.3;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=3;spacingLeft=7;spacingRight=6;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1112" y="3514" width="900" height="160" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="n220" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#333333&quot;&gt;On-board sensors&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9px;color:#666666;font-family:Courier New&quot;&gt;BNO055 IMU ×2 → /pelvis/imu · /torso/imu (+ gravity vectors)&lt;br&gt;Orbbec Gemini 335L/336L RGB-D camera&lt;br&gt;drive telemetry: motor temp · drive temp · bus voltage · error code (TxPDO 0x1A02)&lt;br&gt;absolute encoders, zero-offset calibrated per joint&lt;br&gt;warn/err: motor 70/90°C · drive 70/85°C · 48 V rail 40–54 V&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#333333;dashed=0;arcSize=5;strokeWidth=1.3;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=3;spacingLeft=7;spacingRight=6;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2028" y="3514" width="1316" height="160" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="n221" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#333333&quot;&gt;BRINGUP entry-points + remaining packages  (all 48 src packages represented) · startup ordering&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9px;color:#666666;font-family:Courier New&quot;&gt;arm_system_bringup → headless.launch (sim)    arm_real_bringup → arm_real / position_viewer / recording / safety (CSP·CST)    robot_bringup → robot_pvt / robot_pvt_viewer / remote_view (PVT mode 5)&lt;br&gt;startup chain: ros2_control_node(RT) → joint_state_broadcaster → [filtered + drive_status] → mode_controller → trajectory/effort controllers → homing → safety monitor → joint_state_publisher → RViz   (PVT controller spawned INACTIVE, operator-armed)&lt;br&gt;legacy / stub: gripper_control · hand_control · arm_hardware · gripper_hardware · hand_hardware        meta: ethercat_driver_ros2&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#333333;dashed=0;arcSize=5;strokeWidth=1.3;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=3;spacingLeft=7;spacingRight=6;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="3822" width="3320" height="72" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
